      "en": "The word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와께로부터 예레미야에게 임한 말씀이라 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "0b7aecf94589262a25f4a6d51a5896c92a0223223f69004e738ca7dc8c0970f6",
      "translation_text_hash": "9af4ebee7c4494e7b24e7155d7926fb316db8fec9d49fa44b887fd87c3cb83dd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께로부터 예레미야에게 임한 말씀이라 가라사대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9af4ebee7c4494e7b24e7155d7926fb316db8fec9d49fa44b887fd87c3cb83dd"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JER:11:2",
      "sequence": 19229,
      "chapter_label": "JER 11",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
        "book": "JER",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 2
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Hear the words of this covenant, and speak to the men of Judah, and to the inhabitants of Jerusalem;",
      "ko": "너희는 이 언약의 말을 듣고 유다인과 예루살렘 거민에게 고하라",
      "source_text_hash": "321df26806585388756c8d8dcf1f782ffd1e97b90b940712754e6b285f098710",
      "translation_text_hash": "9bdd97156ffde23ed509fc774dfacd30b189f15d50b1e9655f81e8b54a1c78c9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희는 이 언약의 말을 듣고 유다인과 예루살렘 거민에게 고하라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9bdd97156ffde23ed509fc774dfacd30b189f15d50b1e9655f81e8b54a1c78c9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JER:11:3",
      "sequence": 19230,
      "chapter_label": "JER 11",
