      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD said to me, “A conspiracy is found among the men of Judah, and among the inhabitants of Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 또 내게 이르시되 유다인과 예루살렘 거민 중에 반역이 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "84b2d4ef2b37564540d8cda65d8164ced11704263841a3121cdb1ed3fae69ea2",
      "translation_text_hash": "68b99f52f469617e9151a83beb1e18e28383c60e768a4809bbdc2a7fd7a06186",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 또 내게 이르시되 유다인과 예루살렘 거민 중에 반역이 있도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "68b99f52f469617e9151a83beb1e18e28383c60e768a4809bbdc2a7fd7a06186"
      ]
