        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 17
        }
      ],
      "en": "For the LORD of Armies, who planted you, has pronounced evil against you, because of the evil of the house of Israel and of the house of Judah, which they have done to themselves in provoking me to anger by offering incense to Baal.",
      "ko": "바알에게 분향함으로 나의 노를 격동한 이스라엘 집과 유다 집의 악을 인하여 그를 심은 만군의 여호와 내가 그에게 재앙을 선언하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2de98139ebcc647f9b0f25130c2796dd2d6d527ffd188e83316ebe69a079941a",
      "translation_text_hash": "70d3cdd826322707fcc8a891b9cc5d8ed124dae9362d578344900871b7de5d0a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
